  <p>Explore organizations making a positive difference in their communities.</p>

  <div class="organization-grid">

    <article class="organization-card">
      <img
        src="/images/organization-1.jpg"
        alt="Volunteers working on an environmental conservation project"
      >
      <div class="organization-info">
        <h3>Environmental Organizations</h3>
        <p>Organizations dedicated to protecting nature and promoting a cleaner environment.</p>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="organization-card">
      <img
        src="/images/organization-2.jpg"
        alt="Volunteers helping students with educational activities"
